            "Key": "MagicTree",
            "SourceString": "Humans aren't the only ones with combat triangles. The trees believe that they have one too, with the melee oak, the ranged willow and - evidently - the magic tree. If there were a tree uprising - and that's more likely than you might realise - then these three would be your combat triangle.\r\n\r\nThat uprising would be very slow, of course. You would have some time to prepare. ",
